1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,930
VeriFire gives every high-value product a Solana identity.

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:15,390
Here, a brand registers a batch, and a buyer claims one with its sealed QR.

3
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:20,680
This is the VeriFire website, starting from the home page.

4
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:24,080
First, we sign in to get started.

5
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,930
And here is our company panel.

6
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:30,670
It gives us an overview of everything.

7
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:40,820
Here is the batches section: we pick a product template, our saved products, and we can add an image too.

8
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:46,060
We can also choose the batch and the quantity, and customize the labels.

9
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:54,750
This is where we pay for a batch.

10
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:57,370
It's all done on Solana.

11
00:00:57,520 --> 00:01:00,960
We can pay with Phantom or Solflare.

12
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:05,130
We can also copy the address and the exact amount.

13
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:08,270
Once it's paid, here is our batch,

14
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:14,850
with each product's public QR and secret QR, and the quantity.

15
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,160
And here is the record of everything we did on Solana.

16
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:29,550
Now let's switch to the buyer's side.

17
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:35,460
As a buyer, this is where we see our warranties, the whole system.

18
00:01:35,510 --> 00:01:44,300
We upload the secret QR from one of the products we issued, and activate the warranty with Privy.

19
00:01:44,450 --> 00:01:47,540
We wait a moment while it loads…

20
00:01:47,690 --> 00:01:50,810
…and the warranty is active.

21
00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:57,200
Now we have the owner history,

22
00:01:57,350 --> 00:02:03,440
where the product came from, and its certificate on Solana, right here.

23
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:09,210
Here is the transaction on Solana devnet:

24
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:19,830
the native ed25519 program checks the sealed QR, and our program makes me the owner, only once.

25
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:25,390
It also shows the product was shipped to its destination,

26
00:02:25,540 --> 00:02:31,380
verified through the public QR, and that I'm its only owner.

27
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:38,730
We can also transfer it to someone else, again with Privy. Once we confirm,

28
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,770
the transfer is open.

29
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,850
Now we just wait.

30
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:48,090
The other person opens the link or scans the QR to accept it.

31
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,810
And that's it.

